  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gouvernance local et cohesion social (GOLCOS) 6 regions, Northern and Eastern Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening local governance and social cohesion in crisis af-fected areas in Burkina Faso by capacity building and enhancing dece ntralization, aiming to reinforce social cohesion in the six regions aimed at. These regions are prioritized by the Burkinabe government and the World Bank/UN/EU assessment as crisis regions. These are the regions in the north and east parts of the country, which contains about 1.000.000 Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs).</narrative>
  </description>
